    "directions": [
      "Add all the marination ingredients into bowl except corn flour, maida and oil. Massage the chicken wings with the marination.",
      "Keep aside for 30 minutes.",
      "Heat oil in kadai and just putting into the oil add maida and cornflour into marinated lollipops and coat well.",
      "Deep fry lollipops in batches until turn golden brown and crisp in texture.",
      "Remove on kitchen absorbent paper. Keep aside for later use.",
      "Heat sesame oil into wok.",
      "Add in onion, ginger and garlic. Saute until light pink in colour.",
      "Addin stock followed by all the sauces and stir well.",
      "Adjust salt and add prepared lollipops. Coat well with the sauce and finish with chopped spring onion, fresh green chilli. Stir one last time and serve immediately."
    ],
